{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Magnet Game</i>, a retro-inspired 2D puzzle adventure where opposites don\u2019t just attract \u2013 they\u2019re the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide two marvellous magnets through twisting mazes packed with obstacles, doors, and devious switches. The deeper you go, the more mind-bending the puzzles become \u2013 as left becomes right and every second counts. Connect the magnets as fast as you can to beat the clock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnetic Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Use red and blue charges to activate switches and unlock doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Outsmart pressure plates, buttons, and timer switches across tricky levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Thinking</strong> \u2013 Test both your timing and your logic under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Aesthetic</strong> \u2013 Industrial sci-fi visuals with crisp pixel art and arcade charm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you bring the magnets together before time runs out?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1868330?t=1762500857","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1868330?t=1762500857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868330/46e978518f854e0ca85935bd8f1445ecc581a509/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762500857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1868330/46e978518f854e0ca85935bd8f1445ecc581a509/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762500857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"